l, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">&nbsp;the dashboard as a pdf file.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">The dashboard displays:&nbsp;</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Sales Pipeline&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">- For your Prospects, Leads and Clients, giving you an overview of your ability to convert.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Breakdown by Source&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\">- This allows you to track where you are finding your leads and show you through what source your leads have contacted you.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 700;\">Breakdown by Business Type</span><